      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرَفِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>A camel of a certain excellent sort;</i> (M,
O, K;) a rel. n.: (O, K:) or it is correctly with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">د</span>; (O, * K;) i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدَفِىٌّ</span> [q. v.]: (O:) some say
